1e:["$","p","p-5",{"className":"my-4","children":["The pattern worth naming: ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"className":"font-semibold text-gray-100","children":"a deck is mostly data wearing a layout."}]," Sixty\ncards that differ by a name, a number, and an icon are sixty chances to make a\ncopy-paste mistake — and one balance change means sixty edits."]}]
